1
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:34,680
You're still saying that?

2
00:01:35,220 --> 00:01:36,840
I'll crush you!

3
00:01:37,380 --> 00:01:40,460
King of the pirates, don't make me laugh.

4
00:01:45,820 --> 00:01:48,060
Why did his attack look on me?

5
00:01:49,700 --> 00:01:54,057
A new Haki must be the technique
that old man taught him.

6
00:01:54,140 --> 00:01:57,697
His punches can hurt kaido,
but there's gotta be a trick.

7
00:01:57,780 --> 00:01:58,977
What the hell is it?

8
00:01:59,060 --> 00:02:05,357
We might just win this—that's nice
and all—but before I do anything,

9
00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:07,617
there's something I gotta
get straight with Straw Hats.

10
00:02:07,700 --> 00:02:12,337
Hey, shrimp, you don't even know?

11
00:02:12,420 --> 00:02:17,177
even know What it means to be King of the
Pirates is not something you take lightly.

12
00:02:17,260 --> 00:02:19,140
So stop running your mouth.

13
00:02:25,220 --> 00:02:26,980
He kicked his ass in Curry.

14
00:02:27,500 --> 00:02:29,660
How did he get so much stronger?

15
00:02:33,460 --> 00:02:35,380
Few can stand up to me.

16
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:40,320
And they are not to be underestimated.

17
00:02:46,440 --> 00:02:49,500
I know you didn't come here just to lose.

18
00:02:50,020 --> 00:02:53,520
Are you telling me you think
you're as good as them?

19
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:57,060
Answer me, Straw Hat!

20
00:03:10,440 --> 00:03:11,270
Thunderbogwar!

21
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:21,520
Damn it!

22
00:03:21,820 --> 00:03:25,780
I saw that one coming,
but he's fast! Well done.

23
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:29,179
It's an improvement over
last time, if nothing else.

24
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:30,540
Come on, Kaido!

25
00:03:31,020 --> 00:03:34,280
Honestly, practice
meant to be incinerated!

26
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,070
Prometheus!

27
00:03:37,153 --> 00:03:38,340
Yes, Mama?

28
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:41,800
I'll burn you to ash, boy!

29
00:03:42,980 --> 00:03:44,080
Ha-ha-ha-ha!

30
00:03:44,380 --> 00:03:45,900
Hair badly! Ah!

31
00:03:47,660 --> 00:03:48,740
Foxfire style!

32
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:50,190
Flameran!

33
00:03:54,780 --> 00:03:55,610
Oh!

34
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:57,980
He got Prometheus right in half!

35
00:03:58,380 --> 00:03:59,260
Ha-ha-ha!

36
00:03:59,640 --> 00:04:01,100
That's Kittymon's move!

37
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,640
Nice one, Zoro!

38
00:04:04,580 --> 00:04:05,700
Ha-ha-ha-ha!

39
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:06,860
I stole it!

40
00:04:07,140 --> 00:04:08,600
Oh-oh-oh-oh!

41
00:04:09,180 --> 00:04:10,960
I'm gonna make you pay!

42
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:13,760
Don't lower your guard, Luffy!

43
00:04:14,980 --> 00:04:17,680
You're dealing with two emperors!

44
00:04:23,060 --> 00:04:23,890
Shambles.

45
00:04:34,380 --> 00:04:36,400
Straw Hat, get up.

46
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:37,870
Traffy!

47
00:04:37,953 --> 00:04:39,420
Thanks, you saved me!

48
00:04:41,440 --> 00:04:44,157
Listen, because there's something
you and I need to get straight.

49
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:48,237
Those samurai—I was gonna teleport them to

50
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:50,517
safety anyway—before you
said a damn word to me,

51
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:53,977
but you just had to bark orders.

52
00:04:54,060 --> 00:04:54,890
Do you

53
00:05:00,300 --> 00:05:01,757
know how that made me look?

54
00:05:01,840 --> 00:05:03,897
Taking orders from you
like a damn subordinate!

55
00:05:03,980 --> 00:05:04,921
damn subordinate

56
00:05:05,940 --> 00:05:06,770
Huh?

57
00:05:06,853 --> 00:05:08,120
Why would anyone care about that?

58
00:05:09,540 --> 00:05:11,040
That's the idea, right?

59
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:15,500
You followed Straw Hat's orders
to show your loyalty to him?

60
00:05:16,320 --> 00:05:17,540
Of course not!

61
00:05:17,760 --> 00:05:19,878
Just a loser with a loser underling.

62
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,941
You two were made for each other.

63
00:05:23,020 --> 00:05:25,320
You're the loser, you big stupid jerk!

64
00:05:25,740 --> 00:05:27,280
Was that directed at me?

65
00:05:27,460 --> 00:05:30,720
You can squabble on
your own damn time. Ah!

66
00:05:33,100 --> 00:05:35,100
You're just for me, the astronaut!

67
00:05:35,300 --> 00:05:36,220
Yes, Mama!

68
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:38,280
Heavenly Baba!

69
00:05:42,940 --> 00:05:45,680
Okay, here's the deal! Huh?

70
00:05:46,080 --> 00:05:49,360
The first person who
dodges her attack, loses!

71
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:51,826
Who would agree to that crap?

72
00:05:52,060 --> 00:05:55,277
You're a Gates man and you're
still pulling this nonsense?

73
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:56,800
Go ahead and die!

74
00:05:57,040 --> 00:06:00,197
You don't have what it takes
to make it with real pirates!

75
00:06:00,280 --> 00:06:01,110
You're blinded!

76
00:06:01,193 --> 00:06:02,680
You're losers and I win!

77
00:06:04,100 --> 00:06:05,100
Ah! Whatever.

78
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:07,840
Suit yourselves. I'm not playing.

79
00:06:08,020 --> 00:06:10,697
But if you're not playing, then
why are you still standing here?

80
00:06:10,780 --> 00:06:12,580
Yeah, you wusses! Just go!

81
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:16,760
Hey! Watch out!

82
00:06:27,980 --> 00:06:30,120
Why did you all just stand there?

83
00:06:30,300 --> 00:06:32,380
Ma-ma-ma-ma.

84
00:06:33,080 --> 00:06:34,420
What a pity.

85
00:06:34,940 --> 00:06:37,540
So much for being King of the Pirates.

86
00:06:37,740 --> 00:06:39,360
Now the fun part.

87
00:06:39,660 --> 00:06:43,280
How am I gonna murder
you rotten rats? Who?

88
00:06:43,640 --> 00:06:45,157
Give me a sec, Lin-Lin.

89
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:49,137
I want to see how strong
these kids are, hmm,

90
00:06:49,220 --> 00:06:55,277
that seems like a waste
of time, you stay back!

91
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:57,777
He took Kitty Kamazo, huh, huh?

92
00:06:57,860 --> 00:07:00,757
You think that mask fooled me?

93
00:07:00,840 --> 00:07:07,497
I'd know that laugh anywhere
if I had these punishers!

94
00:07:07,580 --> 00:07:09,837
When we fought, you'd be dead.

95
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:12,080
Zoro Giri.

96
00:07:12,380 --> 00:07:14,040
I seriously doubt that.

97
00:07:40,500 --> 00:07:42,400
Beheading Claw!

98
00:07:42,960 --> 00:07:44,720
Three swords die.

99
00:07:46,540 --> 00:07:47,400
Purgatory!

100
00:07:48,080 --> 00:07:48,910
Onigiri!

101
00:08:05,900 --> 00:08:08,700
It's not enough.

102
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:17,900
That wasn't half bad.

103
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:21,337
I need to unleash a little
more of your power, Enma.

104
00:08:21,420 --> 00:08:22,440
What do you say?

105
00:08:23,340 --> 00:08:24,820
Kaido! Hmm?

106
00:08:26,300 --> 00:08:28,820
We're gonna finish you in one shot.

107
00:08:29,540 --> 00:08:30,900
Fourth gear!

108
00:08:53,140 --> 00:08:55,760
For the Feltzman!

109
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:10,750
No!

110
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:12,260
No!

111
00:09:56,660 --> 00:09:58,340
Let's run!

112
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:02,160
I'm rotten!

113
00:10:14,100 --> 00:10:19,280
Now, Rue, and Tapas.

114
00:11:06,280 --> 00:11:08,517
Each of you a monster in your own right.

115
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:10,420
Just as it should be.

116
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:15,260
Let's see if you have what it
takes to be king of the pirates.

117
00:11:15,660 --> 00:11:17,220
I won't hold back!

118
00:11:23,460 --> 00:11:24,660
Come on!

119
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:34,820
Come on!

120
00:11:38,820 --> 00:11:39,650
No!

121
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:49,320
Ugh, that stung.

122
00:11:49,540 --> 00:11:50,980
Not a bad start.

123
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:57,060
I probably couldn't break
your next skin if I tried,

124
00:11:57,360 --> 00:12:01,478
but that doesn't mean I can't crush
you to death with enough pressure!

125
00:12:06,820 --> 00:12:11,540
You want to see me at my worst, I'm
happy to get you a front row seat!

126
00:12:12,340 --> 00:12:13,380
Fuck me!

127
00:12:31,840 --> 00:12:35,760
That's not bad, but it needs
more mass to seal the deal.

128
00:12:42,640 --> 00:12:43,680
More mass?

129
00:12:43,940 --> 00:12:45,175
Let's try this, then.

130
00:12:45,740 --> 00:12:47,500
What the hell? Now, attack!

131
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:51,150
Crap!

132
00:13:01,980 --> 00:13:03,280
You bastard!

133
00:13:03,700 --> 00:13:06,288
You were gonna take me
out too, weren't you?

134
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:12,817
Damn, that hurt.

135
00:13:12,900 --> 00:13:15,140
You're really trying to bury me.

136
00:13:17,400 --> 00:13:19,380
I remember that feeling.

137
00:13:29,460 --> 00:13:31,700
Reminds me of the good ol' day.

138
00:13:37,940 --> 00:13:39,297
Yummy yum.

139
00:13:39,380 --> 00:13:41,260
All charged and ready to go.

140
00:13:43,760 --> 00:13:45,740
Ma-ma-ma-ma.

141
00:13:48,940 --> 00:13:51,080
Here I thought you were all talk.

142
00:13:51,400 --> 00:13:52,640
That wasn't half bad!

143
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:55,877
If you're crazy enough to
aim for King of the Pirates,

144
00:13:55,960 --> 00:13:57,840
that's the least I can expect.

145
00:14:01,340 --> 00:14:05,560
And yet, none of you have
any hope of stopping me!

146
00:14:19,020 --> 00:14:20,720
Almost breaks my heart.

147
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:25,660
We've come this far, but you'll
all be dead in no time at all.

148
00:14:35,400 --> 00:14:39,020
And I'll take so much
more than just your life.

149
00:14:39,380 --> 00:14:44,060
Like any good pirate, I'll take all
your crew members who followed you here.

150
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:48,140
No way in hell!

151
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:49,640
I'll never let you!

152
00:14:49,920 --> 00:14:51,540
Ma-ma-ma-ma-ma!

153
00:14:52,580 --> 00:14:54,420
Not just your crew members.

154
00:14:54,620 --> 00:14:56,477
We'll take all of your treasures, too.

155
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:58,620
You've got some punoglyphs, right?

156
00:14:58,880 --> 00:15:01,292
A fair prize for what you put me through.

157
00:15:01,680 --> 00:15:03,060
I can't wait.

158
00:15:05,300 --> 00:15:06,947
Didn't think about treasure.

159
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:08,800
I'd be happy to take yours!

160
00:15:12,260 --> 00:15:18,080
Whoever wins this battle will be one
step closer to being king of the pirates.

161
00:15:19,800 --> 00:15:24,160
Yeah, you're right about
that and it's gonna be me.

162
00:15:50,700 --> 00:15:52,920
DEMOLITION DUST.

163
00:16:16,020 --> 00:16:18,120
They were just scraps anyway.

164
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:33,117
You idiots will never
be king of the pirates.

165
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:36,380
But at least you can
entertain me before you die!

166
00:16:42,340 --> 00:16:44,720
The land of Wano is mine!

167
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:47,480
I will bring a new era!

168
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:53,360
Can you carry the weight for me?

169
00:16:55,640 --> 00:16:57,940
Will you deliver this country?

170
00:17:16,080 --> 00:17:17,140
What?

171
00:17:17,340 --> 00:17:19,260
What does it belong to you?

172
00:17:19,860 --> 00:17:21,220
Kong, Kong!

173
00:17:22,740 --> 00:17:24,700
Kong, rifle!

174
00:17:37,560 --> 00:17:39,680
Take it a nap, Mr. Emperor?

175
00:17:40,040 --> 00:17:42,140
Then this is your wake of call.

176
00:17:54,900 --> 00:17:55,737
I'm...

177
00:17:55,820 --> 00:17:57,200
I'm... I'm...

178
00:18:06,380 --> 00:18:07,300
I'm...

179
00:18:10,700 --> 00:18:11,530
No room.

180
00:18:13,200 --> 00:18:14,060
And shambles.

181
00:18:20,700 --> 00:18:23,641
Never seen an anatomical
chart of a dragon before.

182
00:18:29,620 --> 00:18:32,560
But your heart should be here!

183
00:18:34,060 --> 00:18:35,420
Give a knife!

184
00:18:42,300 --> 00:18:46,000
If I can't beat you from the
outside, I'll do it from within!

185
00:18:49,900 --> 00:18:51,660
You're quite the pest.

186
00:19:03,220 --> 00:19:04,777
See if you've done your research.

187
00:19:04,860 --> 00:19:06,800
If you know how durable I am.

188
00:19:07,480 --> 00:19:08,937
Maybe you're not as stupid.

189
00:19:09,020 --> 00:19:10,314
As I thought you were.

190
00:19:12,980 --> 00:19:16,080
Those scales of yours are
a real pain in the ass.

191
00:19:17,020 --> 00:19:19,380
But I know a trick to get inside too.

192
00:19:26,580 --> 00:19:27,620
Scyther!

193
00:19:30,280 --> 00:19:31,110
Sonic!

194
00:19:42,960 --> 00:19:45,300
That one hurt, didn't it?

195
00:19:47,060 --> 00:19:48,640
Now die!

196
00:20:00,660 --> 00:20:04,380
As long as you're under the
open sky, you're my prey.

197
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:07,680
You didn't think you could
escape from me, did you?

198
00:20:08,300 --> 00:20:14,480
I admit, my expectations weren't
exactly high, but this has been fun.

199
00:20:15,260 --> 00:20:16,980
I know! Schneider!

200
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:25,277
Look at you.

201
00:20:25,360 --> 00:20:26,560
Not bad.

202
00:20:33,620 --> 00:20:34,780
Hey, Traffy!

203
00:20:35,180 --> 00:20:37,004
Teleport me up there and hurry!

204
00:20:38,080 --> 00:20:38,910
What?

205
00:20:38,993 --> 00:20:41,871
I'm not a moving service, and
I don't take orders from you!

206
00:20:43,540 --> 00:20:47,160
I'll do it because I want to,
not because you told me to!

207
00:20:48,580 --> 00:20:49,780
Foxfire style!

208
00:20:55,960 --> 00:20:57,160
Glass bread!

209
00:21:04,800 --> 00:21:05,880
Flame red!

210
00:21:12,540 --> 00:21:13,760
Thanks, Zoro!

211
00:21:15,240 --> 00:21:16,680
Let's try again!

212
00:21:18,560 --> 00:21:19,390
Traffy!

213
00:21:20,700 --> 00:21:21,530
Huh?

214
00:21:21,613 --> 00:21:22,443
I told you!

215
00:21:22,526 --> 00:21:24,940
Stop acting like you're my boss, dammit!

216
00:21:31,780 --> 00:21:33,560
What the hell?

217
00:21:35,800 --> 00:21:37,720
Out of the way, Kaido!

218
00:21:38,060 --> 00:21:40,640
That's no ordinary weapon he's got!

219
00:21:41,700 --> 00:21:43,340
One sword style!

220
00:21:52,640 --> 00:21:55,040
Blood! Dragon! Blaze!

221
00:22:06,440 --> 00:22:08,540
What is this power I feel?

222
00:22:09,260 --> 00:22:10,090
How?

223
00:22:10,173 --> 00:22:11,740
Why is Odin's presence in his sword?

224
00:22:13,460 --> 00:22:14,337
Tang it!

225
00:22:14,420 --> 00:22:15,657
I missed you!

226
00:22:15,740 --> 00:22:18,360
This is what you get
for taking us lightly!

227
00:22:19,060 --> 00:22:19,890
Indra!

228
00:22:26,760 --> 00:22:27,590
Zoro!

229
00:22:28,600 --> 00:22:30,780
Ma-ma-ma-ma!

230
00:22:31,860 --> 00:22:32,960
Look at that!

231
00:22:33,180 --> 00:22:34,380
All lined up for me!

232
00:22:35,980 --> 00:22:41,120
Heaven's wrath, god of
lightning tension, heed my call!

233
00:22:47,620 --> 00:22:50,760
That woman is a living calamity!

234
00:23:26,880 --> 00:23:28,237
What in the hell?!

235
00:23:28,320 --> 00:23:32,144
How did you survive all that
lightning without a scratch on you?!

236
00:23:38,260 --> 00:23:39,160
Tush!

237
00:23:39,360 --> 00:23:41,160
I'm a robber man!

238
00:23:41,800 --> 00:23:42,630
Huh?

239
00:23:44,920 --> 00:23:47,700
You're gonna pay for hurting my friends!

240
00:23:50,700 --> 00:23:52,080
Blast friends!

241
00:24:23,440 --> 00:24:25,020
Fire doesn't work either.

242
00:24:25,320 --> 00:24:26,540
Why the hell not?

243
00:24:30,000 --> 00:24:31,220
Cause God!

244
00:24:34,380 --> 00:24:36,360
Come out!

245
00:24:47,380 --> 00:24:48,210
Got me!

246
00:25:04,380 --> 00:25:05,440
AAAAAA!
